start.welcome:
⌯ <b>Welcome to the media downloader</b>

✦ Send a Telegram post link to download its media, including content from public or private channels and channels that disable forwarding. You can also download multiple posts, transfer a complete channel, apply a custom thumbnail to files, or send downloaded content directly to another channel

✦ Linked account: {account_status}

